    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Druids on the Path of Balance become fierce combatants capable of calling upon the forces of nature and the beloved goddess Elune to guide their hand. Many of these druids have a deep connection with the natural world and work to protect it from the many outside threats.</p><h2>Path Spells</h2><table><tbody><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Druid Level</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Spells</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3rd</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.9eOZDBImVKxbeOyZ]{Enhance Ability}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.bV3yun6MIuFj71Er]{Moonbeam}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5th</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.BP3GCwa66IAw1yTG]{Daylight}, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.spells.Item.XqMSXwE6ALQBBu78]{Starsurge}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">7th</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.9hQXdMSmerkTsHDe]{Confusion}, Grasping Vine</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"54\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">9th</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.dp6xny4v8PDoIGjh]{Commune with Nature}, Wrath of Nature</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
